      "purpose": "Self-contained browser documentation samples of native component roles. They do not implement the native app or validate native operation.",
      "tokens": "Resolved literal values because the production tokens live in Python, not inherited CSS custom properties.",
      "icons": "Samples omit platform/application icon assets; native identity comes from those real assets, not surrogate logos.",
      "focus": "Browser focus-visible outlines on field, segmented control and switch are panel affordances, not separately authored native field-focus tokens.",
      "tonalRamps": "Eight synthetic OKLCH lightness steps per source color for the documentation swatch panel only; not production palette tokens.",
      "motion": "No browser transition is added as a production motion token."
    }
