      "description": "Text and supporting note carry state; data-state classes illustrate the native semantic colors.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-status\" data-state=\"standby\"><strong class=\"ds-status-title\">● Standby</strong><span class=\"ds-status-note\">Protection has not started</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-status{font-family:\"SF Pro Text\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:5px 16px;border:1px solid #DFE5EE;border-radius:12px;background:#F6F8FB;color:#58677B}.ds-status-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.ds-status-note{font-size:10px;margin-top:3px}.ds-status[data-state=\"running\"] .ds-status-title{color:#21835A}.ds-status[data-state=\"muted\"] .ds-status-title{color:#886016}.ds-status[data-state=\"error\"] .ds-status-title,.ds-status[data-state=\"alert\"] .ds-status-title{color:#BC3D42}.ds-status[data-state=\"starting\"] .ds-status-title{color:#005FCC}"
